{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34281","headline":"迎潮送潮辞 迎潮 · 陆龟蒙","name":"迎潮送潮辞 迎潮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江霜严兮枫叶丹，潮声高兮墟落寒。\n鸥巢卑兮渔箔短，远岸没兮光烂烂。\n潮之德兮无际，既充其大兮又充其细。\n密幽人兮欵柴门，寂寞流连兮依稀旧痕。\n濡腴泽槁兮潮之恩，不尸其功兮归於混元。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}